    [missing_case] scope-exclusion-bullets-become-absence-obligations/exclusion-flag-depends-on-section-parse
      The absence status depends on requirement.section being EXCLUSION. A bullet under the heading that the parser files under another section, such as a nested bullet, a differently formatted heading, or a bullet split across lines, gets no absence treatment and no negative-form handling.
